WEBVTT

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.302
It was good to make
your acquaintance, Jacob.

00:00:18.844 --> 00:00:20.637
And I hope you get your bakery.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.692
GRAVES: You're an interesting man,
Mr. Scamander.

00:00:33.859 --> 00:00:35.277
Mr. Graves.

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:47.205
You were thrown out of Hogwarts
for endangering human life.

00:00:47.372 --> 00:00:49.499
-That was an accident.
-With a beast.

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:53.879
Yet one of your teachers argued strongly
against your expulsion.

00:00:54.046 --> 00:00:55.213
Now,

00:00:56.882 --> 00:00:59.426
what makes Albus Dumbledore

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:01.762
so fond of you?

00:01:06.808 --> 00:01:08.268
I really couldn't say.

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:11.563
So setting a pack
of dangerous creatures loose here was

00:01:14.983 --> 00:01:17.486
just another accident. Is that right?

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.654
Why would I do it deliberately?

00:01:19.821 --> 00:01:21.823
To expose wizardkind.

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:25.744
To provoke war between
the magical and non-magical worlds.

00:01:26.578 --> 00:01:29.414
Mass slaughter
for the greater good, you mean?

00:01:32.042 --> 00:01:33.085
Yes.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.295
Quite.

00:01:36.588 --> 00:01:40.258
I'm not one of Grindelwald's
fanatics, Mr. Graves.

00:01:43.762 --> 00:01:48.141
I wonder what you can tell me
about this, Mr. Scamander.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:03.949
It's an Obscurus.

00:02:04.616 --> 00:02:05.784
But it's not what you think.

00:02:05.951 --> 00:02:07.828
I managed to separate it
from the Sudanese girl

00:02:08.036 --> 00:02:09.121
as I tried to save her.

00:02:09.287 --> 00:02:11.206
So I wanted to take it home to study it.

00:02:11.373 --> 00:02:12.791
But it cannot survive outside that.

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:14.793
It could not hurt anyone, Tina.

00:02:15.043 --> 00:02:16.878
So it's useless without the host?

00:02:17.754 --> 00:02:19.131
Useless?

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:21.758
Useless?

00:02:24.302 --> 00:02:28.473
That is a parasitical,
magical force that killed a child.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.725
What on earth would you use it for?

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:39.276
You fool nobody, Mr. Scamander.

00:02:39.443 --> 00:02:41.153
You brought this Obscurus
into the City of New York

00:02:41.319 --> 00:02:43.196
in the hope of causing mass disruption,

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:46.241
breaking the Statute of Secrecy
and revealing the magical world.

00:02:46.408 --> 00:02:47.576
You know that can't hurt anyone.
You know that.

00:02:47.742 --> 00:02:49.411
You are therefore guilty of
a treasonous betrayal

00:02:49.578 --> 00:02:51.663
of your fellow wizards
and are sentenced to death.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.166
Miss Goldstein,
who has aided and abetted you--

00:02:54.332 --> 00:02:55.792
No, she's done nothing of the kind.

00:02:55.959 --> 00:02:57.794
Receives the same sentence.

00:02:58.503 --> 00:02:59.504
(CRYING)

00:03:00.172 --> 00:03:01.506
Just do it immediately.

00:03:01.673 --> 00:03:03.842
-I will inform President Picquery myself.
-Tina.

00:03:04.301 --> 00:03:05.844
-Shh.
-(TINA SOBBING)

00:03:06.094 --> 00:03:07.179
Please.

00:03:08.263 --> 00:03:09.306
(SOBBING CONTINUES)

00:03:20.859 --> 00:03:23.528
Don't do this, Bernadette. Please.

00:03:24.696 --> 00:03:26.364
It don't hurt.

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:29.993
(SOBBING CONTINUES)

00:04:03.485 --> 00:04:04.569
TINA'S MOTHER: Tina.

00:04:04.736 --> 00:04:05.779
Momma?

00:04:06.821 --> 00:04:08.323
Tina.

00:04:10.617 --> 00:04:12.452
Come on, pumpkin. Time for bed.

00:04:13.161 --> 00:04:14.538
Are you ready?

00:04:14.996 --> 00:04:17.415
Don't that look good?

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.255
You wanna get in, huh?

00:04:26.758 --> 00:04:27.759
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

00:04:32.389 --> 00:04:33.515
Hey, Sam.

00:04:33.682 --> 00:04:35.267
-Hey, Queenie.
-They need you downstairs.

00:04:35.433 --> 00:04:36.643
I'll Obliviate this guy.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:38.186
You ain't qualified.

00:04:39.938 --> 00:04:41.106
Hey, Sam.

00:04:41.439 --> 00:04:43.441
Does Cecily know you been seeing Ruby?

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.404
-How did you--
-Let me Obliviate this guy,

00:04:47.571 --> 00:04:49.281
and she'll never hear about it from me.

00:04:53.451 --> 00:04:54.578
What are you doing?

00:04:54.786 --> 00:04:57.289
Hush. Teen's in trouble.
I'm trying to listen.

00:04:57.581 --> 00:04:58.957
Jacob, where's Newt's case?

00:04:59.124 --> 00:05:01.042
I think that guy Graves took it.

00:05:01.418 --> 00:05:02.961
Okay. Come on.

00:05:03.378 --> 00:05:04.921
What, you're not gonna Obliviate me?

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.717
Of course not. You're one of us now.

00:05:13.722 --> 00:05:15.348
TINA'S MOTHER: Tina.

